title: 12V Power Outlet (Power Point) Timeout Duration
raw_community_title: Powerpoint Timeout Duration (1 second)
category: Convenience and Electrical
platform: Explorer
model_years: 2025-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2025-2026 Explorer.xlsx
notes: 'turns off power point to 1 second after vehicle shuts off. Range: 1 - 64800.
  0001 for 1 second, 001E for 30 seconds, 003C for 1 minute, 012C for 5 minutes, 0258
  for 10 minutes, 0708 for 30 minutes, and 0E10 for 1 hour. FD20 for 18 hours'
